git:index/branch:Branch.description:
Tracks a branch's base ref within a repository, and optionally an ordered patch stack applied on top of it. When <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`patches`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Patches`" pulumi-lang-go="`patches`" pulumi-lang-python="`patches`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`patches`" pulumi-lang-java="`patches`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`patches`">`patches`</span> is set, the resulting commits are force-pushed to the branch on the remote; otherwise this resource only resolves and tracks the observed base ref.

